Package: roundsui
Title: Shared UI Components and Design Tokens for the Rounds Ecosystem
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Fred", "Buckhold", , "fbuckhold3@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared Shiny UI components, design tokens, and theming
    ("Ward Notes") for the rounds ecosystem of internal medicine GME
    applications, independent of any one app's REDCap data-loading layer.
    Component families: shared feedback/state (loading, empty, error),
    shell/navigation, data-visualization wrappers, and data-entry patterns.
